WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.570
Every year, pilgrims dressed in white
walk between two small hills in Makkah.

2
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.950
They go from one hill to
the other, again and again,

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.310
seven times, now inside
a long covered gallery.

4
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.020
Along one marked stretch,
the men break into a hurry.

5
00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.830
Muslims believe they are retracing
a mother's search for water,

6
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.320
long ago, in a dry valley.

7
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.850
So who was she?

8
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.170
In this mission, you'll follow
the story back to Ibrahim,

9
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.060
and the building of the Ka'bah.

10
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:35.410
Then you'll see what pilgrims wear, and why
they walk seven times around the Ka'bah.

11
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:40.990
Your mission: find out who she was, and
why pilgrims still retrace her search.
